// Main menu scene: mainmenu.ini (next to THUGPro.exe) sets the menu level, where the skater
// stands, how they pose and where the camera goes. Spots, poses and cameras can each be "static"
// (always the same one) or "cycle" (change on a timer / each menu visit). The ini is re-read every
// time the main menu level loads, so edits show up after backing out to the menu.
// Included after modes.inc (uses its ExeDirFile/ReadWholeFile/WriteWholeFile/RetInt/IntParam).
//
// QB side (Levels.q, thugpro_menu_* scripts):
//   THUGRECOMP_MenuLevel            -> level (0 skate shop, 1 East LA); re-reads the ini, picks the spot
//   THUGRECOMP_MenuSpot             -> spot_pos, spot_dir (vectors) when a spot applies
//   THUGRECOMP_MenuTick sx sy sz    -> cam_pos/cam_dir (vectors) while a camera applies; when the pose
//                                      changes: pose_script (name) or pose_anims + pose_a1..pose_a4
//   THUGRECOMP_MenuMark kind="spot"|"camera" px py pz dx dy dz  -> appends a section, returns index
//   THUGRECOMP_MenuSetHere level px py pz dx dy dz -> [home <level>] spot + camera, menu level set (Quick Menu)
//   THUGRECOMP_MenuSaved star_pick=N -> on: stars / unstars a custom menu (custom_stars)
//   THUGRECOMP_MenuSavedDelete pick -> a saved [home <level>] moved to dadmod\backups\deleted_menus\ (Custom menus)
//   THUGRECOMP_MenuCamEdit begin / query / sx sy sz -> free cam on the menu scene; done = 1 saved / 2 canceled
// MenuTick also takes ctx (which screen: main list, Dadmod pages or an Edit Skater screen) and fx fy fz (the
// skater's facing). Camera changes glide over blend_seconds; orbit start angles count from the skater's front.

