";   orbit  circles the skater: radius, height, speed (degrees/second, minus = other way),\r\n"
";          start (degrees from the skater's front: 0 = looking at their face, 90 = their side, 180 = behind),\r\n"
";          range (full = circles; 180 = sweep back and forth across their front only, e.g. by a wall)\r\n"
";   pan    glides from pos to pos2 and back over seconds, aiming at the skater\r\n"
";   sway   like fixed but drifts gently by amount\r\n"
"; look = height on the skater to aim at (default 40). spot = only use with that spot number (0 = any).\r\n"
"[camera 1]\r\n"
